LRC14 DERIVED AP/GW TOURNAMENT NECESSARY-CONDITION ATLAS
==============================================================================
External analogies:
  Tao-derived multiplicative functions: first coefficients of rigid
    multiplicative identities over dual-number extensions.
  Collatz/Farey lower-bound style: a cycle must live in a rational
    approximant corridor; wrong Farey child means escape from the apex.

