[Even antipodal binder-slot cycle]
  slots: A={2,12}, B={4,10}, C={6,8}
  AP has one binder in each slot.  An even tail petal moves one binder.
  edge  row           M      Farey index  GW no-unit gate
  C->A   8->16       2/23      -5        False
  B->C  10->20       2/27      -1        False
  A->B  12->24       1/14       0        True
  Only A->B, the 12->24 edge, is tight at denominator 14.

